  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\qt0010_f75ff8cf134b.jpeg\"/><p>Let, vector from point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> to point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> be <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math>, </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi> </mi><mover><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mi> </mi><mover><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mi> </mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mover><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mover><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>Q</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi> </mi><mover><mi>P</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>From triangle rule of vector addition, </p><p><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi> </mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math></p><p><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi> </mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi> </mi><mover><mi>S</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>P</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mover><mi>Q</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math></p>"
